menu "Yaykit UI"

config YK_UI_PIP_BUILTIN
    bool "Pip's pictures in the image"
    default y
    help
        Pip's poses (firmware/assets/yay: 16 pictures, 628,416 bytes) are built into the image, as every firmware has
        them. Off (Yay from 0.1.18, Yay 0.1.18 开发文档 4.2): only greet_132 (18,464 bytes) is, and every pose is drawn
        as it until the firmware hangs Pip's pack with yk_yay_pip(): Yay reads it from Pip's place in `models`. An
        extension leaves this on: it has no Pip's place of its own to read.

config YK_UI_BUDDY_DEFAULT
    bool "Every Yay is the user's buddy"
    default y
    help
        yk_yay_create() draws the buddy the user chose (development kit 1.10, YK_API_LEVEL 5; 开发包四个伙伴-需求确认.md
        §4): Pip, or Mote, Dial or Bloom from the pack the main firmware keeps in a buddy slot (about 630 KB of PSRAM,
        read once a run on the first Yay made), Pip when it is not there. yk_yay_buddy() names another. Off (Yay): every
        Yay is Pip until a pack is hung with yk_yay_figure(), as before; Yay hangs its packs itself.

endmenu
